          <p class="text-body-large text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Learning journeys can't be designed in a vacuum. They need to be shaped by the people who do the work — organizers who've run trainings, coordinators who've fielded questions, communities who've survived floods and started rebuilding.
          </p>
