            <div class="process-phase__number">1</div>
            <h3 class="process-phase__title">Listen</h3>
            <p class="process-phase__period">Month 1</p>
            <ul class="process-phase__list">
              <li>In-person sessions with Rad Weavers organizers</li>
              <li>Multi-org input: what do different organizations need from the toolkit?</li>
              <li>Mapping how people actually use the toolkit today vs. how they explain it in trainings</li>
              <li>Identifying what gets re-explained every time — that's what the journey automates</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="process-phase__deliverable">
              <strong>Delivers:</strong> Journey maps for 3–4 roles; stage definitions
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Phase 2 -->
          <div class="process-phase" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">
            <div class="process-phase__number">2</div>
            <h3 class="process-phase__title">Build &amp; Test</h3>
            <p class="process-phase__period">Month 2</p>
            <ul class="process-phase__list">
              <li>Iterative design-build cycles: low-fidelity flows → live implementation → feedback</li>
              <li>Real interfaces, not mockups — organizers see working pages</li>
              <li>Field testing during actual trainings and TA sessions</li>
              <li>Adjustments based on what people actually do, not what we assume</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="process-phase__deliverable">
              <strong>Delivers:</strong> Live journey paths on ResilienceToolkit.org
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Phase 3 -->
          <div class="process-phase" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="200">
            <div class="process-phase__number">3</div>
            <h3 class="process-phase__title">Refine &amp; Sustain</h3>
            <p class="process-phase__period">Month 3 + Months 4–12</p>
            <ul class="process-phase__list">
              <li>Stabilize based on real use during Month 3</li>
              <li>Months 4–12: light maintenance informed by ongoing organizer feedback</li>
              <li>Quarterly reporting on what's working, what needs adjustment</li>
              <li>Documentation so the community can steward the journeys independently</li>
              <li>Complete handoff documentation — admin guides, update procedures, and architecture overview so the system runs independently</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="process-phase__deliverable">
              <strong>Delivers:</strong> Stable system + maintenance log + internal guide
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

